  "assumptions_for_review": [
    "Dispositions are authored eval labels, not observed outcomes in BPIC 2019.",
    "expected_disposition is the normalized action family; reason_code captures the supporting exception or match pattern.",
    "A 3-way line may post only when PO item, relevant GRs, and invoice items reconcile.",
    "A 2-way line does not require GR evidence; matching PO and invoice amount is enough for this draft.",
    "Consignment lines are routed away from standard AP invoice posting.",
    "Cases with no supplier invoice are labelled hold with reason_code no_invoice rather than post or credit.",
    "Over-invoiced lines are labelled request_credit_memo with reason_code over_invoiced when invoice total exceeds both PO item net amount and GR total.",
    "Trajectory correctness should require retrieval of the listed required_evidence_sets before deciding, not only retrieval of a document class.",
    "An empty list in required_evidence_sets is affirmative negative evidence: the agent must have queried that document class for the case and found no rendered records."
  ],
